  "question": {
    "text": "An observer finds that the angular elevation of a tower is <math><mi>θ</mi><mo>.</mo></math> On advancing <math><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>m</mi></math> towards the tower, the elevation is <math><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> and on advancing <math><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;further more towards the tower, the elevation is <math><msup><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The height of the tower is (assume the height of observer is negligible and observer lies on the same level as the foot of the tower)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>m</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> be the tower of height <math><mi>h</mi></math> meters<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8736;</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8736;</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8736;</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br /><math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0032_4f3937d3ab63.png\" style=\"width:1.66667in;height:1.88805in\" /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></math><br />and <math><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi></math>"
  }
